<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss bonds closing prices.</title>
<headline>Swiss bonds closing prices.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss franc bonds were broadly lower for much of the day but recovered towards the close to end mixed.</p>
<p>Prices eased early but without selling pressure.</p>
<p>Conf government bond futures recovered from early lows, helped by short-covering.</p>
<p>Analysts said the Conf future may target 116.00 near-term, with some seeing scope for gains to 118.00 if the 116.00 area can be broken to the upside.</p>
<p>In the shorter maturities, the 4-1/2 percent government bond ended down three basis points at 107.13.</p>
